To reintroduce a biological dimension, even in the complex way Deleuze likely intended it within his own system, felt to Foucault like a massive step backward.

19:14.140 --> 19:18.160
Like it undermined decades of his work showing how these categories are constructed, not given.

19:18.480 --> 19:19.880
So it wasn't just a personal slight.

